                                {
                                  "metadata": {
                                    "name": "Construct LLM Input From Receipt Line",
                                    "returnType": "object",
                                    "sourceCode": "const CategoryId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.ShipmentLine.CategoryId;\nconst SourceDocumentCode = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.SourceDocumentCode;\nconst VendorId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.SupplierId;\nconst FromOrganizationId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.ShipmentLine.FromOrganizationId;\nconst CustomerId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.CustomerId;\nconst ParentTransactionType = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.TransactionType;\nconst InspectionStatusCode = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.InspectionStatusCode;\nconst UOMCode = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.UomCode;\nconst ProjectId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.ProjectId;\nconst TaskId = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.TaskId;\nconst CountryOfOriginCode = $context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.$currentItem.CountryOfOriginCode;\n\nconst currentReceiptLine = Object.fromEntries(\n  Object.entries({\n    CategoryId,\n    SourceDocumentCode,\n    VendorId,\n    FromOrganizationId,\n    CustomerId,\n    ParentTransactionType,\n    InspectionStatusCode,\n    UOMCode,\n    ProjectId,\n    TaskId,\n    CountryOfOriginCode\n  }).filter(([, attribute]) => attribute !== null && attribute !== undefined)\n);\n\nreturn currentReceiptLine;"
                                  },
                                  "outcomes": {
                                    "success": "1773926757115"
                                  },
                                  "code": "CONSTRUCT_LLM_INPUT_FROM_RECEIPT_LINE",
                                  "id": "1773928908263",
                                  "inputs": [],
                                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                                  "type": "CODE"
                                },
                                {
                                  "metadata": {
                                    "name": "Recommend Subinventory And Locator By Comparing ReceiptLine To HistoricalData"
                                  },
                                  "outcomes": {
                                    "success": "1774591793820"
                                  },
                                  "code": "RECOMMEND_SUBINVENTORY_AND_LOCATOR_BY_COMPARING_RECEIPTLINE_TO_HISTORICALDATA",
                                  "id": "1773930242541",
                                  "inputs": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "1773930242542_1",
                                      "name": "prompt",
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "value": "You are given: \n\n    receiptLine = {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.CONSTRUCT_LLM_INPUT_FROM_RECEIPT_LINE.$output.result}} \n    historicalData = {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.FETCH_RECEIVING_INBOUND_ADVISOR_PUT_AWAY_TRANSACTIONS.$output.items}} \n     \n\nYour task: \n\n   Attribute-agnostic comparison:\n      Do not assume any fixed schema. Compare only attributes present in receiptLine (excluding attributes whose value is null).\n      For each row in historicalData, count how many attributes exactly match the same attribute names and values in receiptLine.\n      All attributes are equal weight. No semantic interpretation of attribute names or values. Exact equality only.\n       \n   Selection:\n      Identify the row(s) with the highest number of matching attributes.\n      If there is a tie, select the tied row with the latest value of TransactionDate (use only TransactionDate for tie-breaking; assume ISO-8601 strings and compare as timestamps).\n       \n   Strict Output Format:\n      Return a JSON object with:\n      {\n        \"Subinventory\": \"<value from the selected historical row (if present; otherwise null)>\",\n        \"LocatorId\": \"<value from the selected historical row (if present; otherwise null)>\",\n        \"rationale\": \"Explain which attributes matched and why this row was selected, including any tie-break by latest TransactionDate.\"\n      }\n       \n   Constraints:\n      Do not infer or interpret meanings of attributes.\n      Do not hallucinate any fields or values not present in the inputs.\n      If Subinventory is missing in the selected historical row, set it to null in the output.\n      If LocatorId is missing in the selected historical row, set it to null in the output.\n      If historicalData is empty, return Subinventory: null, LocatorId: null, and a rationale stating no rows to compare."
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Rationale\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"LocatorId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Subinventory\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                                  "type": "LLM"
                                },
                                {
                                  "metadata": {
                                    "name": "Check For Historic Data Recommended Subinventory"
                                  },
                                  "outcomes": {
                                    "true": "1774613479942",
                                    "false": "add_false_1774591793820"
                                  },
                                  "code": "CHECK_FOR_HISTORIC_DATA_RECOMMENDED_SUBINVENTORY",
                                  "convergenceTargetId": "end_1773816392650",
                                  "id": "1774591793820",
                                  "inputs": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "1774591793822_1",
                                      "name": "condition",
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "value": "{{$context.$nodes.LOOP_OVER_ELIGIBLE_RECEIPT_LINES.RECOMMEND_SUBINVENTORY_AND_LOCATOR_BY_COMPARING_RECEIPTLINE_TO_HISTORICALDATA.$output.Subinventory != null}}"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "type": "CONDITION"
                                },
